{"id":"bazzle","name":"Bazzle","type":"character","aliases":["old man","the clockmaker"],"description":"A one-armed clockmaker shunned by his village for surviving the creeping plague, who is overpowered and beheaded by his own clockwork creation.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2012-07-10","last_seen":"2012-07-10","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e0","summary":"Bazzle wakes to a cry of alarm and realizes that his clockwork creation has escaped again.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":2,"quote":"It got out again. My creation continues to defy my wishes!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=It%20got%20out%20again.,to%20defy%20my%20wishes%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=It%20got%20out%20again.,to%20defy%20my%20wishes%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e1","summary":"Bazzle recalls how he built his greatest creation, and finds strange objects and keys left in his shop.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":9,"quote":"Mostly, he found strange keys, hundreds of them, filling small burlap sacks and stacked near the door.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Mostly%2C%20he%20found%20strange,stacked%20near%20the%20door.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Mostly%2C%20he%20found%20strange,stacked%20near%20the%20door.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e2","summary":"Bazzle finds a crude brass clockwork arm on his workbench and realizes it is made of melted keys.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":17,"quote":"Keys. This is made of melted keys.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Keys.%20This%20is%20made%20of%20melted%20keys.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Keys.%20This%20is%20made%20of%20melted%20keys.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e3","summary":"Bazzle realizes the creature has learned its creator's trade and effectively become his apprentice.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":19,"quote":"Now, it seemed, he finally had an apprentice.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Now%2C%20it%20seemed%2C%20he%20finally%20had%20an%20apprentice.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Now%2C%20it%20seemed%2C%20he%20finally%20had%20an%20apprentice.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e4","summary":"Bazzle tries to dislodge the creature's chest key, but the creature winds itself and strikes him in the face.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":21,"quote":"Before Bazzle could do anything, the hand swung back and struck him squarely in the face.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Before%20Bazzle%20could%20do,squarely%20in%20the%20face.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Before%20Bazzle%20could%20do,squarely%20in%20the%20face.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e5","summary":"On the second morning Bazzle finds a severed clockwork head made from the guard's helmet, his own reading crystals and the stirrups and teeth.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":26,"quote":"This was a clockwork head.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=This%20was%20a%20clockwork%20head.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=This%20was%20a%20clockwork%20head.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e6","summary":"As Bazzle crawls to the key, the creature strikes the back of his neck and slides the key into place.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"just as the thing's arm connected with the back of his neck.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=just%20as%20the%20thing%27s,back%20of%20his%20neck.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=just%20as%20the%20thing%27s,back%20of%20his%20neck.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e7","summary":"On the third morning Bazzle finds his good arm severed and the metal arm attached in its place.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":32,"quote":"his formerly good arm lay severed on the floor near his bed","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=his%20formerly%20good%20arm,floor%20near%20his%20bed","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=his%20formerly%20good%20arm,floor%20near%20his%20bed","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e8","summary":"Bazzle realizes the creature never wanted a companion or army, only to stop sharing a body with him.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":171,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":34,"quote":"It had merely decided it would no longer share a body with a rotting old clockmaker.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/